==English==

===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|recrūdēscō||I become raw again|lang=la}}; from {{term|re-|lang=la}} + {{term|crūdēscō||I become harsh or raw|lang=la}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~}}

# The state or condition of being [[recrudescent]].
#: ''A '''recrudescence''' of barbarism may condemn it [land] to chronic poverty and waste.'' &mdash; Duke of Argyll.
# {{context|medicine|lang=en}} the [[acute]] [[recurrence]] of a [[disease]], or its [[symptom]]s, after a period of [[improvement]]

